.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-3tlgwm/TASK-260715-3tlgwm_rework-02-evidence.md:9:- A stop that wins before start records terminal ownership before suspension, enters the existing stopping/cleanup path, releases the retained configuration reference, and prevents revival.
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-3tlgwm/TASK-260715-3tlgwm_rework-02-evidence.md:10:- Repeated stop remains idempotent; the accepted startup-completion health/cancellation handoff remains unchanged.
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-3tlgwm/TASK-260715-3tlgwm_rework-02-evidence.md:14:- `stopBeforeStart` calls stop twice before start, then proves start throws `generationAlreadyConsumed`.
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-3tlgwm/TASK-260715-3tlgwm_rework-02-evidence.md:15:- `stopWinsConcurrentStart` pauses stopping-snapshot publication after stop records ownership, runs start while stop remains in flight, and proves the same rejection before releasing cleanup.
