.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-3tlgwm/TASK-260715-3tlgwm_review-changes-02.md:10:The reported startup-completion health handoff race is closed. After the startup child returns, start now revalidates caller cancellation, environment cancellation, actor state, and termination before clearing startupTask with no intervening suspension. The two new deterministic tests force current-generation DNS health loss and caller cancellation into that handoff; neither issues a later stop, and both prove exactly-once reverse cleanup plus internal and external resource baselines.
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-3tlgwm/TASK-260715-3tlgwm_review-changes-02.md:14:A stop that serializes before start is discarded, so the stopped generation can later start and the stop does not return retained configuration references to baseline.
