.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-3tlgwm/TASK-260715-3tlgwm_spawn-log_-implementer--developer--codex-.log:226:> Rework 02: close stop-before-start generation revival and retained configuration leak
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-3tlgwm/TASK-260715-3tlgwm_spawn-log_-implementer--developer--codex-.log:230:Implement the reviewer-required stop-before-start fix. The authoritative verdict is TASK-260715-3tlgwm_review-changes-02.md. A stop that serializes while the generation is initially disconnected must terminally consume/cancel that generation, release the retained configuration reference, prevent any later start from reviving it, remain idempotent, and complete cleanup exactly once. Add deterministic stop-before-start and stop-wins concurrent start/stop tests proving no settings or usable capability is published and both internal resourceFootprint and external ledger return to baseline. Preserve the accepted startup-completion handoff fix and its regression tests. Run focused normal + TSan, make validate-core, strict format lint, diff check, and board validation.
