.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_spawn-log_-analyst--solution-architect--codex-.log:47188: - IMPLEMENTATION: Both protocol bindings consume the checked `lcg64-v1` regression corpus. Four fixed 64-bit seeds drive 2,096 deterministic cases across both envelope directions, legal and mutated frames, hostile declared lengths, arbitrary chunking/coalescing, inner HEV parsing, EOF, cancellation, and reset. Each language derives the same four stable semantic digests, so code/phase/scope/disposition or ordering drift fails the common gate without comparing implementation-specific error text.
